CoPlan 3.0 — a big quality release.
• Money: net balance at a glance, one-tap settle-up in both directions, receipt photos on expenses, and notifications when your co-parent adds an expense or records a payment.
• Schedule: the dashboard now shows who has the kids today and tomorrow, the calendar supports swiping between weeks/months, and new requests pre-fill the selected day.
• Requests: see past requests, and add a reason when declining.
• Join by invite link, friendlier error messages, dark-mode polish, and many fixes — including events saving correctly while typing and expense details updating after edits.
